<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Our Love Story</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff7e5f, #feb47b);
      color: white;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
      position: relative;
    }
    .message, .memory, #finalMessage {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 2s forwards;
    }
    .message h1, .memory h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .message button {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      background-color: #ff7e5f;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .message button:hover {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; }
      to { opacity: 1; }
    }
    .rose-petals, .fireworks {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: -1;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .rose-petals {
      background: url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/rose-petals.png') repeat;
      animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes float {
      0% { top: 0; opacity: 1; }
      50% { top: -20px; opacity: 0.5; }
      100% { top: 0; opacity: 1; }
    }
    .fireworks h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: #ffcc00;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      animation: explode 2s forwards;
    }
    @keyframes explode {
      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0; }
      100% { transform: scale(3); opacity: 1; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="message" id="message">
      <h1>Every love story is special… but ours is my favorite.</h1>
      <button onclick="showMemories()">Start</button>
    </div>
    <div class="memory" id="memory1">
      <h2>The day I saw you in that blue kurtha… I couldn’t resist coming back to see you again.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="memory" id="memory2">
      <h2>The day we almost let each other go because of family… You said, "Afno khyaal rakha la," and I cried even more.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="memory" id="memory3">
      <h2>The day you made me heart-shaped noodles and fed me with your hands… We hugged and didn’t want to let go.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="memory" id="memory4">
      <h2>The day we held hands in the rain as I left for Nepal… I wished that moment could last forever.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="memory" id="finalMessage">
      <h1>No matter what happens, you’ll always be my forever. Happy Valentine’s Day, my love.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="rose-petals"></div>
    <div class="fireworks"></div>
  </div>

  <audio id="bg-music" loop>
    <source src="https://www.bensound.com/bensound-music/bensound-romantic.mp3" type="audio/mp3">
  </audio>

  <script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
      document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
      document.getElementById("bg-music").play();
    });

    let currentMemory = 1;
    function showMemories() {
      if (currentMemory <= 4) {
        document.getElementById(`memory${currentMemory}`).style.display = "block";
        currentMemory++;
        setTimeout(showMemories, 6000);
      } else {
        document.getElementById("finalMessage").style.display = "block";
        triggerFireworks();
      }
    }

    function triggerFireworks() {
      const fireworks = document.querySelector(".fireworks");
      fireworks.innerHTML = '<h1>🎆 Fireworks 🎆</h1>';  
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
